<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The humanoid entities in this skip remind me of that of <a href="/scp-1312">SCP-1312</a>. They both involve possibly mindless humanoid entities trying to protect/contain something, whether it's a site or a person.</p>
<p>Editing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>it is not currently known if instances are capable of understanding said speech.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>it is not currently known if instances are capable of understanding said speech<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-638259-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-638259-1')">1</a></sup>.</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>It's also come to my attention that BananaRepublic has deleted their Wikidot account. Did they give their skips away to anybody?</p>
